    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/conference-event-planner/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Conference Event is a versatile and feature-rich theme designed for creating and managing professional conferences, congresses, seminars, workshops, and a wide range of event-related websites, offering a comprehensive suite of tools tailored for event organizers, event planning, conference coordinators, event management teams, keynote speakers, event sponsors, attendees, seminar organizers, trade show organizers, corporate events, and exhibition planners. With its modern, visually appealing, and paperless approach, the theme helps deliver a seamless digital experience, including customized invitation systems, event registration, networking events, workshop facilitation, sponsor management, attendee engagement, and event promotion. It provides extensive customization options, allowing users to personalize colors, fonts, and layouts to match event branding while maintaining a professional online presence. Key features include an intuitive event management system for scheduling, speaker profiles, session details, and ticketing, along with integrated online registration and booking for smooth attendee participation. The responsive design ensures optimal performance across all devices, enhancing accessibility, while compatibility with essential plugins supports payment gateway integration and social media promotion. Additionally, the theme includes tools for showcasing event galleries, highlighting past and upcoming events with countdown timers, and a built-in blog feature for sharing updates, insights, and news, making it an all-in-one solution for modern event experiences."
    },
